              <td class="py-3 fw-500 text-white font-inter fs-14">Priority Customer Support</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-center text-white-50 font-inter fs-14">None (Forums only)</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-center fw-700 text-white font-inter fs-14 sh-popular-col" style="color: #00FF88 !important;">24/7 Priority Support</td>
              <td class="py-3 text-center text-white-50 font-inter fs-14">Email support only</td>
