            </h2>
            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-body text-white-50 fs-14 py-3 px-4" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); line-height: 1.7;">
                The free .site domain is automatically bundled with your annual Student Hosting Plan purchase. Simply enter the domain name you want during checkout, and it will be registered with a 100% discount.
              </div>
